    "text": "11 hours ago EFFINGHAM, IL, Nov. 18, 2025 – Navi Arora, MD, FACP, a board-certified internist practicing in Effingham, has been elected a Fellow of the American College of Physicians (ACP), the society of internists. This prestigious distinction recognizes his achievements in internal medicine, the specialty of adult medical care. Dr. Arora... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
